        UA_free(dc);
    }
}
```

The `dc` is the `entry->cleanupCallback` which is embedded in the `channel_entry`. When `UA_free(dc)` is called, it frees the `channel_entry` struct. But the callback `dc->callback(dc->application, dc->data)` is called BEFORE `UA_free(dc)`, so that should be fine.

