    UA_SecureChannel_deleteMembersCleanup(&entry->channel);
}
```

This just cleans up the channel members. It doesn't free the entry. So the entry is freed later by `UA_free(dc)` in `UA_WorkQueue_manuallyProcessDelayed`.

